{# One logo inside a manual card: the picture plus the admin pencil that sizes
   THIS card.

   The size comes from `Manual::logoDisplayWidth()` — the card's own override
   first, then the logo variant's "Šířka loga v manuálu", then nothing. Every
   logo card in the manual goes through here, which is what makes the
   variant-level setting reach all of them.

   The value is a % of the logo's DEFAULT size in this card (`LogoScale`,
   100 % = výchozí). It is rendered as `--logo-scale` only: app.css multiplies
   it into the default width and the default height cap (`--logo-cap`) of
   every card type, so the logo scales exactly from wherever the stylesheet
   puts it — no aspect ratio or card geometry needed here — and growing is
   clamped to the frame (`width` never exceeds 100 %).

   The pencil only opens the page's ONE width bar (`manual_logo_width_controller.js`,
   mounted on the manual root in manual_preview.html.twig) — the bar previews
   the width live on the `<img>` it finds by `data-logo-slot` and saves without
   a reload. Top-LEFT corner on purpose: the download and colour-mapping
   buttons already own the right-hand corner, and not every card carries both.

   Params: manual, logo (SvgImage), colorsMapping, slot (string),
           logo_variant (string). #}
{% set display_scale = manual.logoDisplayScale(slot, logo_variant) %}
{% if is_granted('manual_edit', manual) %}
    <button type="button"
            class="btn btn-sm btn-soft-primary p-1 px-2 manual-logo-width-edit"
            title="Šířka loga v tomto rámečku"
            data-action="manual-logo-width#open"
            data-manual-logo-width-slot-param="{{ slot }}"
            data-manual-logo-width-slot-width-param="{{ manual.logoSlotWidth(slot) }}"
            data-manual-logo-width-variant-width-param="{{ manual.logoVariantWidth(logo_variant) }}">
        <i class="mdi mdi-arrow-expand-horizontal"></i>
    </button>
{% endif %}
<img src="{{ remap_svg_colors(logo.filePath, colorsMapping) }}" data-logo-slot="{{ slot }}"
     {%- if display_scale is not null %} style="--logo-scale: {{ display_scale }}"{% endif %}>
